    "id": 80,
    "question": "A company runs an IoT platform on AWS. IoT sensors in various locations send data to the company’s Node.js API servers on Amazon EC2 instances running behind an Application Load Balancer. The data is stored in an Amazon RDS MySQL DB instance that uses a 4 TB General Purpose SSD volume. The number of sensors the company has deployed in the eld has increased over time, and is expected to grow signi cantly. The API servers are consistently overloaded and RDS metrics show high write latency. Which of the following steps together will resolve the issues permanently and enable growth as new sensors are provisioned, while keeping this platform cost-e cient? (Choose two.)",
    "question_zh": "某公司在AWS上运作物联网平台。不同位置的 IoT 感测器将数据传送到在 Application Load Balancer 后面运行的 Amazon EC2 实例上的公司 Node.js API 服务器。数据存储在使用 4 TB 通用 SSD 卷的 Amazon RDS MySQL 数据库实例中。随著时间的推移，该公司在现场部署的传感器数量不断增加，并且预计将大幅增长。 API 服务器持续过载，RDS 指标显示写入延迟较高。下列哪一项步骤将永久解决这些问题，并随著新感测器的配置而成长，同时维持该平台的成本效益？ （选两个。）",
    "options": [
      {
        "letter": "A",
        "text": "Resize the MySQL General Purpose SSD storage to 6 TB to improve the volume’s IOPS.",
        "text_zh": "将 MySQL 通用 SSD 存储大小调整为 6 TB，以提高卷的 IOPS。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "B",
        "text": "Re-architect the database tier to use Amazon Aurora instead of an RDS MySQL DB instance and add read replicas.",
        "text_zh": "重新架构数据库层以使用 Amazon Aurora 而不是 RDS MySQL 数据库实例并新增只读副本。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "C",
        "text": "Leverage Amazon Kinesis Data Streams and AWS Lambda to ingest and process the raw data.",
        "text_zh": "利用 Amazon Kinesis Data Streams 和 AWS Lambda 摄取和处理原始数据。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "Use AWS X-Ray to analyze and debug application issues and add more API servers to match the load.",
        "text_zh": "使用AWSX-Ray分析和侦错应用程序问题并新增更多API服务器以符合负载。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "E",
        "text": "Re-architect the database tier to use Amazon DynamoDB instead of an RDS MySQL DB instance.",
        "text_zh": "重新架构数据库层以使用 Amazon DynamoDB 而不是 RDS MySQL 数据库实例。"
      }
    ],
    "correct_answers": [
      "C",
      "E"
    ],
    "community_vote": [],
