    "question": "A company has its cloud infrastructure on AWS. A solutions architect needs to de ne the infrastructure as code. The infrastructure is currently deployed in one AWS Region. The company’s business expansion plan includes deployments in multiple Regions across multiple AWS accounts. What should the solutions architect do to meet these requirements?",
    "question_zh": "一家公司的云端基础设施位于AWS。解决方案架构师需要将基础架构定义为代码。该基础设施目前部署在一个AWSRegion中。该公司的业务扩展计划包括跨多个 AWS 账户在多个 Regions 中进行部署。解决方案架构师应该怎么做才能满足这些要求？",
    "options": [
      {
        "letter": "A",
        "text": "Use AWS CloudFormation templates. Add IAM policies to control the various accounts, Deploy the templates across the multiple Regions.",
        "text_zh": "使用AWS CloudFormation模板。新增IAM策略来控制各个账户，跨多个Regions部署模板。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "B",
        "text": "Use AWS Organizations. Deploy AWS CloudFormation templates from the management account Use AWS Control Tower to manage deployments across accounts.",
        "text_zh": "使用AWS Organizations。从管理账户部署 AWS CloudFormation 模板 使用 AWS Control Tower 管理跨账户的部署。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "C",
        "text": "Use AWS Organizations and AWS CloudFormation StackSets. Deploy a Cloud Formation template from an account that has the necessary IAM permissions.",
        "text_zh": "使用AWS Organizations和AWS CloudFormation堆栈集。从具有必要的 IAM 权限的账户部署 Cloud Formation 模板。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "Use nested stacks with AWS CloudFormation templates. Change the Region by using nested stacks.",
        "text_zh": "使用带有 AWS CloudFormation 模板的嵌套堆栈。使用嵌套堆栈更改 Region。"
      }
    ],
