    "question": "A company is planning to migrate an application to AWS. The application runs as a Docker container and uses an NFS version 4 le share. A solutions architect must design a secure and scalable containerized solution that does not require provisioning or management of the underlying infrastructure. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
    "question_zh": "一家公司正计划将应用程序迁移到AWS。该应用程序作为 Docker 容器运行并使用 NFS 版本 4 文件共用。解决方案架构师必须设计一个安全且可扩展的容器化解决方案，该解决方案不需要配置或管理底层基础架构。哪种解决方案可以满足这些要求？",
