        "text": "Deploy the application containers by using Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) with the Fargate launch type. Use Amazon Elastic File System (Amazon EFS) for shared storage. Reference the EFS le system ID, container mount point, and EFS authorization IAM role in the ECS task de nition.",
        "text_zh": "使用 Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) 和 Fargate 启动类型来部署应用程序容器。使用Amazon Elastic File System (Amazon EFS)进行共享存储。参考ECS任务定义中的EFS文件系统ID、容器挂载点和EFS授权IAM角色。"
