    "id": 217,
    "question": "A company uses a load balancer to distribute tra c to Amazon EC2 instances in a single Availability Zone. The company is concerned about security and wants a solutions architect to re-architect the solution to meet the following requirements: • Inbound requests must be ltered for common vulnerability attacks. • Rejected requests must be sent to a third-party auditing application. • All resources should be highly available. Which solution meets these requirements?",
    "question_zh": "一家公司使用负载均衡器，将流量分发到同一可用区中的 Amazon EC2 实例。公司希望架构师重新设计方案以满足以下安全要求：过滤入站请求中的常见漏洞攻击；将被拒绝的请求发送到第三方审计应用；所有资源都应高可用。哪种方案能满足这些要求？",
