    "question": "A solutions architect needs to review the design of an Amazon EMR cluster that is using the EMR File System (EMRFS). The cluster performs tasks that are critical to business needs. The cluster is running Amazon EC2 On-Demand Instances at all times for all task, primary, and core nodes. The EMR tasks run each morning, starting at 1:00 AM. and take 6 hours to nish running. The amount of time to complete the processing is not a priority because the data is not referenced until late in the day. The solutions architect must review the architecture and suggest a solution to minimize the compute costs. Which solution should the solutions architect recommend to meet these requirements?",
    "question_zh": "解决方案架构师需要检视使用 EMR 文件系统 (EMRFS) 的 Amazon EMR 集群的设计。集群执行对业务需求至关重要的任务。集群始终为所有任务、主节点和核心节点执行 Amazon EC2 按需实例。 EMR 任务每天早上运行，从凌晨 1:00 开始。并需要6小时才能完成运作。完成处理的时间量不是优先考虑的问题，因为直到当天晚些时候才会引用数据。解决方案架构师必须审查架构并提出解决方案以最大限度地降低计算成本。解决方案架构师应该推荐哪一种解决方案来满足这些要求？",
