    "question": "A company wants to use Amazon S3 to back up its on-premises le storage solution. The company’s on-premises le storage solution supports NFS, and the company wants its new solution to support NFS. The company wants to archive the backup les after 5 days. If the company needs archived les for disaster recovery, the company is willing to wait a few days for the retrieval of those les. Which solution meets these requirements MOST cost-effectively?",
    "question_zh": "一家公司想要使用 Amazon S3 来备份其 on-premises 文件存储解决方案。该公司的on-premises文件存储解决方案支持NFS，并且该公司希望其新解决方案支持NFS。该公司希望在 5 天后归档备份文件。如果公司需要归档文件进行灾难恢复，公司愿意等待几天来检索这些文件。哪种解决方案最经济有效率地满足这些要求？",
