    "id": 376,
    "question": "A company that provides image storage services wants to deploy a customer-facing solution to AWS. Millions of individual customers will use the solution. The solution will receive batches of large image les, resize the les, and store the les in an Amazon S3 bucket for up to 6 months. The solution must handle signi cant variance in demand. The solution must also be reliable at enterprise scale and have the ability to rerun processing jobs in the event of failure. Which solution will meet these requirements MOST cost-effectively?",
    "question_zh": "一家提供图片存储服务的公司希望在 AWS 上部署面向客户的方案，供数百万个人客户使用。方案需要接收成批的大图片文件，调整图片尺寸，并将文件在 Amazon S3 桶中最多保存 6 个月。方案必须应对需求的大幅变化，在企业规模下保持可靠，并能在失败时重新运行处理任务。哪种方案能以最低成本满足这些要求？",
