        "text": "Modify the Kinesis Data Firehose configuration and Athena table de nition to partition the data by date and time. Change the Athena query to view the relevant partitions.",
        "text_zh": "修改 Kinesis Data Firehose 配置及 Athena 表定义，按日期和时间对数据进行分区。修改 Athena 查询，使其仅查看相关分区。"
