        "letter": "D",
        "text": "Create an FSx for Windows File Server le system in the DR Region. Establish connectivity between the VPC in the primary Region and the VPC in the DR Region by using AWS Transit Gateway in each Region. Use AWS Transfer Family to copy les between the FSx for Windows File Server le system in the primary Region and the FSx for Windows File Server le system in the DR Region over the private AWS backbone network.",
        "text_zh": "在灾备区域创建一个 FSx for Windows File Server 文件系统。通过各区域中的 AWS Transit Gateway，连接主区域的 VPC 与灾备区域的 VPC。使用 AWS Transfer Family，通过 AWS 私有骨干网络，在主区域与灾备区域的 FSx for Windows File Server 文件系统之间复制文件。"
