    "question": "A retail company is mounting IoT sensors in all of its stores worldwide. During the manufacturing of each sensor, the company’s private certi cate authority (CA) issues an X.509 certi cate that contains a unique serial number. The company then deploys each certi cate to its respective sensor. A solutions architect needs to give the sensors the ability to send data to AWS after they are installed. Sensors must not be able to send data to AWS until they are installed. Which solution will meet these requirements?",
    "question_zh": "一家零售公司正在全球所有门店安装物联网（IoT）传感器。在每个传感器的制造过程中，公司的私有证书颁发机构（CA）会签发一张包含唯一序列号的 X.509 证书，然后将该证书部署到对应的传感器上。解决方案架构师需要让这些传感器在安装完成后能够向 AWS 发送数据，但在安装之前不得向 AWS 发送数据。哪种方案能够满足这些要求？",
