        "text": "Explicitly deny bucket creation from all users and roles except for an AWS Service Catalog launch constraint role. De ne a Service Catalog product for the creation of the S3 bucket to force S3 Versioning and MFA Delete to be enabled. Authorize users to launch the product when they need to create an S3 bucket.",
        "text_zh": "明确拒绝所有用户和角色建立存储桶，AWS Service Catalog 启动约束角色除外。定义一个服务目录产品，用于建立 S3 存储桶，以强制启用 S3 版本控制和 MFA 删除。授权用户在需要建立S3存储桶时启动产品。"
