    "id": 431,
    "question": "A company provides a centralized Amazon EC2 application hosted in a single shared VPC. The centralized application must be accessible from client applications running in the VPCs of other business units. The centralized application front end is configured with a Network Load Balancer (NLB) for scalability. Up to 10 business unit VPCs will need to be connected to the shared VPC. Some of the business unit VPC CIDR blocks overlap with the shared VPC, and some overlap with each other Network connectivity to the centralized application in the shared VPC should be allowed from authorized business unit VPCs only. Which network configuration should a solutions architect use to provide connectivity from the client applications in the business unit VPCs to the centralized application in the shared VPC?",
    "question_zh": "一家公司在一个共享 VPC 中集中运行 Amazon EC2 应用。其他业务部门 VPC 内的客户端应用需要访问它。集中式应用的前端使用 Network Load Balancer（NLB）以支持扩展。最多有 10 个业务部门 VPC 需要连接该共享 VPC。其中部分 VPC 的 CIDR 地址段与共享 VPC 重叠，部分业务 VPC 的地址段彼此也重叠。只有获授权的业务部门 VPC 才能连接该应用。架构师应采用哪种网络配置？",
    "options": [
      {
        "letter": "A",
        "text": "Create an AWS Transit Gateway. Attach the shared VPC and the authorized business unit VPCs to the transit gateway. Create a single transit gateway route table and associate it with all of the attached VPCs. Allow automatic propagation of routes from the attachments into the route table. Configure VPC routing tables to send tra c to the transit gateway.",
        "text_zh": "创建一个AWS Transit Gateway。将共享VPC和授权业务单元VPC附加到中转网关。建立单一中转网关路由表并将其与所有附加的 VPC 关联。允许将路由从附件自动传播到路由表中。设定 VPC 路由表以将流量传送至中转网关。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "B",
        "text": "Create a VPC endpoint service using the centralized application NLB and enable the option to require endpoint acceptance. Create a VPC endpoint in each of the business unit VPCs using the service name of the endpoint service. Accept authorized endpoint requests from the endpoint service console.",
        "text_zh": "使用集中式应用的 NLB 创建 VPC 端点服务，并启用要求接受端点连接请求的选项。使用该端点服务的服务名称，在每个业务部门 VPC 中创建 VPC 端点。在端点服务控制台中接受获授权的端点连接请求。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "C",
        "text": "Create a VPC peering connection from each business unit VPC to the shared VPAccept the VPC peering connections from the shared VPC console. Configure VPC routing tables to send tra c to the VPC peering connection.",
        "text_zh": "从每个业务部门 VPC 到共享 VPC 创建 VPC 对等连接。在共享 VPC 的控制台接受这些连接，并配置 VPC 路由表，将相应流量发送到对等连接。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "Configure a virtual private gateway for the shared VPC and create customer gateways for each of the authorized business unit VPCs. Establish a Site-to-Site VPN connection from the business unit VPCs to the shared VPC. Configure VPC routing tables to send tra c to the VPN connection.",
        "text_zh": "为共享VPC配置虚拟专用网关，并为每个授权业务部门VPC建立客户网关。建立从业务单元VPC到共享VPC的Site-to-Site VPN连接。配置 VPC 路由表以将流量传送至 VPN 连接。"
      }
    ],
