    "question": "A company is migrating its on-premises IoT platform to AWS. The platform consists of the following components: • A MongoDB cluster as a data store for all collected and processed IoT data. • An application that uses Message Queuing Telemetry Transport (MQTT) to connect to IoT devices every 5 minutes to collect data. • An application that runs jobs periodically to generate reports from the IoT data. The jobs take 120-600 seconds to nish running. • A web application that runs on a web server. End users use the web application to generate reports that are accessible to the general public. The company needs to migrate the platform to AWS to reduce operational overhead while maintaining performance. Which combination of steps will meet these requirements with the LEAST operational overhead? (Choose three.)",
    "question_zh": "一家公司正在将其on-premises IoT 平台迁移到AWS。此平台由以下组件组成： • MongoDB 集群作为所有收集和处理的物联网数据的数据存储。 • 使用消息队列遥测传输(MQTT) 每5 分钟连接到IoT 设备以收集数据的应用程序。 • 定期执行作业以根据IoT 数据产生报表的应用程序。这些作业需要 120-600 秒才能完成运行。 • 在Web 服务器上执行的Web 应用程序。最终用户使用 Web 应用程序产生可供公众访问的报告。该公司需要将平台迁移到AWS，以在保持性能的同时减少运维开销。哪种步骤组合能够以最少的运维开销满足这些要求？ （选择三项。）",
