    "id": 512,
    "question": "A media company has a 30-T8 repository of digital news videos. These videos are stored on tape in an on-premises tape library and referenced by a Media Asset Management (MAM) system. The company wants to enrich the metadata for these videos in an automated fashion and put them into a searchable catalog by using a MAM feature. The company must be able to search based on information in the video, such as objects, scenery items, or people’s faces. A catalog is available that contains faces of people who have appeared in the videos that include an image of each person. The company would like to migrate these videos to AWS. The company has a high-speed AWS Direct Connect connection with AWS and would like to move the MAM solution video content directly from its current le system. How can these requirements be met by using the LEAST amount of ongoing management overhead and causing MINIMAL disruption to the existing system?",
    "question_zh": "一家媒体公司拥有 30 TB 的数位新闻影片存储库。这些影片存储在on-premises磁带库中的磁带上，并由媒体资产管理 (MAM) 系统引用。该公司希望以自动化的方式丰富这些影片的元数据，并使用 MAM 功能将它们放入可搜寻的目录中。公司必须能够根据影片中的资讯进行搜索，例如物体、风景或人脸。提供了一个目录，其中包含影片中出现的人员的脸孔，其中包括每个人的图像。该公司希望将这些影片迁移到AWS。该公司拥有与 AWS 的高速AWS Direct Connect 连接，并希望直接从其当前的文件系统移动 MAM 解决方案视讯内容。如何通过使用最少的持续管理开销并对现有系统造成最小的干扰来满足这些要求？",
    "options": [
      {
        "letter": "A",
        "text": "Set up an AWS Storage Gateway, le gateway appliance on-premises. Use the MAM solution to extract the videos from the current archive and push them into the le gateway. Use the catalog of faces to build a collection in Amazon Rekognition. Build an AWS Lambda function that invokes the Rekognition Javascript SDK to have Rekognition pull the video from the Amazon S3 les backing the le gateway, retrieve the required metadata, and push the metadata into the MAM solution.",
        "text_zh": "在本地部署一个 AWS Storage Gateway 文件网关设备。使用 MAM 解决方案从现有归档中提取视频，并将视频推送到文件网关。利用现有的人脸目录，在 Amazon Rekognition 中创建一个集合。编写一个 AWS Lambda 函数，调用 Rekognition JavaScript SDK，让 Rekognition 从文件网关后端的 Amazon S3 文件中读取视频，提取所需元数据，再将元数据写入 MAM 解决方案。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "B",
        "text": "Set up an AWS Storage Gateway, tape gateway appliance on-premises. Use the MAM solution to extract the videos from the current archive and push them into the tape gateway. Use the catalog of faces to build a collection in Amazon Rekognition. Build an AWS Lambda function that invokes the Rekognition Javascript SDK to have Amazon Rekognition process the video in the tape gateway, retrieve the required metadata, and push the metadata into the MAM solution.",
        "text_zh": "设定 AWS Storage Gateway、磁带网关设备 on-premises。使用 MAM 解决方案从目前文件中提取视讯并将其推送到磁带网关。使用脸部目录在 Amazon Rekognition 中建立集合。建立一个 AWS Lambda 函数，调用 Rekognition Javascript SDK，让 Amazon Rekognition 处理磁带网关中的视频，检索所需的元数据，并将元数据推送到 MAM 解决方案中。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "C",
        "text": "Configure a video ingestion stream by using Amazon Kinesis Video Streams. Use the catalog of faces to build a collection in Amazon Rekognition. Stream the videos from the MAM solution into Kinesis Video Streams. Configure Amazon Rekognition to process the streamed videos. Then, use a stream consumer to retrieve the required metadata, and push the metadata into the MAM solution. Configure the stream to store the videos in Amazon S3.",
        "text_zh": "使用 Amazon Kinesis Video Streams 配置一个视频摄取流。利用现有的人脸目录，在 Amazon Rekognition 中创建一个集合。将视频从 MAM 解决方案流式传输到 Kinesis Video Streams。配置 Amazon Rekognition 处理这些视频流。然后使用流消费者获取所需元数据，并将元数据写入 MAM 解决方案。配置该流，将视频存储到 Amazon S3。"
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "Set up an Amazon EC2 instance that runs the OpenCV libraries. Copy the videos, images, and face catalog from the on-premises library into an Amazon EBS volume mounted on this EC2 instance. Process the videos to retrieve the required metadata, and push the metadata into the MAM solution, while also copying the video les to an Amazon S3 bucket.",
        "text_zh": "设定运行 OpenCV 库的 Amazon EC2 实例。将on-premises库中的视讯、图像和人脸目录复制到安装在此EC2实例上的AmazonEBS卷中。处理视讯以检索所需的元数据，并将元数据推送到 MAM 解决方案中，同时也将视讯文件复制到 Amazon S3 存储桶。"
      }
    ],
