    "id": 522,
    "question": "A company in the United States (US) has acquired a company in Europe. Both companies use the AWS Cloud. The US company has built a new application with a microservices architecture. The US company is hosting the application across ve VPCs in the us-east-2 Region. The application must be able to access resources in one VPC in the eu-west-1 Region. However, the application must not be able to access any other VPCs. The VPCs in both Regions have no overlapping CIDR ranges. All accounts are already consolidated in one organization in AWS Organizations. Which solution will meet these requirements MOST cost-effectively?",
    "question_zh": "美国 (US) 的一家公司收购了欧洲的一家公司。两家公司都使用AWS云。这家美国公司建构了一个采用微服务架构的新应用程序。这家美国公司在 us-east-2 Region 的 5 个 VPC 上托管该应用程序。应用程序必须能够访问 eu-west-1 Region 中的一个 VPC 中的资源。但是，应用程序不得访问任何其他VPC。两个 Regions 中的 VPC 没有重叠的 CIDR 范围。所有账户均已合并到 AWS Organizations 的一个组织中。哪一种解决方案能够最具成本效益地满足这些要求？",
