        "letter": "A",
        "text": "Create one transit gateway in eu-west-1. Attach the VPCs in us-east-2 and the VPC in eu-west-1 to the transit gateway. Create the necessary route entries in each VPC so that the tra c is routed through the transit gateway.",
        "text_zh": "在 eu-west-1 中建立一个中转网关。将 us-east-2 中的 VPC 和 eu-west-1 中的 VPC 连接到中转网关。在每个VPC中建立必要的路由条目，以便流量通过中转网关进行路由。"
